 as an umbrella partnership REIT, or UPREIT. We have elected to be taxed as a REIT under the Internal Revenue Code of 1986, as amended (the \"Internal Revenue Code\"). To the extent we continue to qualify as a REIT, we will not be subject to U.S. federal tax, with certain exceptions, on our REIT taxable income that is distributed to our stockholders.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Self Storage Operations","val":2895190000,"zh":"Self Storage Operations"},{"name":"Tenant Reinsurance","val":352876000,"zh":"Tenant Reinsurance"}],"total":3377542000}},"peers":["PSA","MAA","ESS","CUBE","ARE"]}}